  {
   "id": 27,
   "type": "text",
   "title": "How to read this supervised MVP",
   "gridPos": {
    "x": 0,
    "y": 40,
    "w": 24,
    "h": 9
   },
   "options": {
    "mode": "markdown",
    "content": "**Scope:** one separately authorized $1 total-debit SOL buy; $0.002 explicit fee cap; $0.50 realized-loss limit. No automatic strategy, retries, second trade or sell. The loss limit is not a guaranteed market stop-loss.\n\n**Cost evidence:** 20 bp explicit fee plus an observed 0.000550840 SOL buy-output deduction on the prior owner trade. The configured 0.002039280 SOL maximum is a conservative allowance with zero assumed sponsor credit. These are different quantities; neither establishes future route costs.\n\n**Balances:** last reviewed TM/on-chain account snapshot. The age above advances even while the observer is healthy. Deposits or trades after that timestamp are not reflected until reconciliation refreshes the evidence.\n\n**Settlement:** this view reports durable local stages, not economic settlement. Actual received SOL, final fees, fill price, trade markers and P&L require a verified settlement record. They are deliberately not synthesized from a quote or a submitted transaction. No settled live trade has yet been established by this cluster.\n\n**Expiry:** account review expiry stops this supervised runtime. Preserve all recovery journals; never initialize again to restart. Paper metrics remain on the separate Paper trading tab."
   }
